					receiverId: message.receiverId.toString(),
					type: 'file',
					content: fullFileUrl,
					fileName: fileName,
					fileSize: formatFileSize(fileSize),
					isSelf: true,
					time: new Date(message.timestamp).toLocaleString(),
					timestamp: message.timestamp,
					showTime: true,
					avatarText: message.avatarText,
					avatarBg: message.avatarBg,
					status: message.status
				} as MessageItem
				
				messages.value.push(uiMessage)
				showPlusMenu.value = false
				
				setTimeout(() => {
					scrollToBottom()
				}, 100)
			}).catch((err) => {
				console.error('[Chat] 上传文件失败:', err)
				uni.showToast({ title: '上传失败', icon: 'none' })
			})
			return
		}

		if (item.nameKey === 'chat.features.location') {
			showPlusMenu.value = false

			// 注册一次性 eventbus 监听（全平台兼容，H5 端 getOpenerEventChannel 不可用）
			const onSelectLocation = (payload: any) => {
				uni.$off('imSelectLocation', onSelectLocation)
				try {
					const latitude = payload != null && (payload as any).latitude != null ? Number((payload as any).latitude) : NaN
					const longitude = payload != null && (payload as any).longitude != null ? Number((payload as any).longitude) : NaN
					if (isNaN(latitude) || isNaN(longitude)) {
						uni.showToast({ title: '位置信息无效', icon: 'none' })
						return
					}
					const address = payload != null && (payload as any).address != null ? String((payload as any).address) : ''
					const locationName = payload != null && (payload as any).name != null ? String((payload as any).name) : ''
					const provider = payload != null && (payload as any).provider != null ? String((payload as any).provider) : 'tencent'
					sendLocationCard(latitude, longitude, address, locationName, provider)
				} catch (e) {
					console.error('[Chat] 接收位置选择结果失败:', e)
					uni.showToast({ title: '发送失败', icon: 'none' })
				}
			}
			uni.$on('imSelectLocation', onSelectLocation)

			uni.navigateTo({
				url: '/pages/message/location-search',
				fail: (err) => {
					uni.$off('imSelectLocation', onSelectLocation)
					console.error('[Chat] 打开位置搜索页失败:', err)
					uni.showModal({
						title: '位置功能异常',
						content: '无法打开位置搜索页，是否直接发送当前位置？',
						confirmText: '发送定位',
						cancelText: '取消',
						success: (res) => {
							if (res.confirm === true) {
								void fallbackSendCurrentLocation('open_location_search_page_failed')
							}
						}
					})
				}
			})
			return
		}
		if (item.nameKey === 'chat.features.card') {
			void chooseContactCardAndSend()
			return
		}
		if (item.nameKey === 'chat.features.fav') {
			showPlusMenu.value = false
			uni.navigateTo({
				url: '/pages/common/favorite'
			})
			return
		}
		
		uni.showToast({
			title: t(item.nameKey) + '功能开发中',
			icon: 'none'
		})
	}
	
	/**
	 * 格式化文件大小
	 */
	function formatFileSize(size : number) : string {
		if (size < 1024) {
			return size + ' B'
		} else if (size < 1024 * 1024) {
			return (size / 1024).toFixed(2) + ' KB'
		} else if (size < 1024 * 1024 * 1024) {
			return (size / 1024 / 1024).toFixed(2) + ' MB'
		} else {
			return (size / 1024 / 1024 / 1024).toFixed(2) + ' GB'
		}
	}

	async function handleImagePreview(msg : any) {
		try {
			let url = msg && msg.content ? String(msg.content) : ''
			if (IM_MEDIA_USE_FILE_ID === 'true' && msg && msg.fileId) {
				const signed = await resolvePresignedUrl(String(msg.fileId))
				if (signed) {
					url = signed
				}
			}
			if (!url) {
				uni.showToast({ title: '图片地址为空', icon: 'none' })
				return
			}
			uni.previewImage({
				urls: [url]
			})
		} catch (e) {
			console.error('[Chat] 图片预览失败:', e)
			uni.showToast({ title: '预览失败', icon: 'none' })
		}
	}

	function canAddMessageToSticker(msg : any) : boolean {
		try {
			if (msg == null) {
				return false
			}
			const type = msg.type != null ? String(msg.type) : ''
			if (type === 'emoji' || type === 'sticker') {
				return true
			}
			if (type !== 'image') {
				return false
			}
			const url = extractMediaUrl(msg.content != null ? msg.content : '')
			if (url === '') {
				return false
			}
			const lowerUrl = url.toLowerCase()
			const mimeType = (msg as any).mimeType != null ? String((msg as any).mimeType).toLowerCase() : ''
			const isAnimatedImage = mimeType.indexOf('gif') > -1 || mimeType.indexOf('webp') > -1
				|| lowerUrl.endsWith('.gif') || lowerUrl.endsWith('.webp')
			if (!isAnimatedImage) {
				return false
			}
			const messageId = msg.messageId != null ? String(msg.messageId) : ''
			return messageId !== '' && messageId !== '0'
		} catch (e) {
			return false
		}
	}

	function looksLikeLinkContent(text: string): boolean {
		if (text == null) {
			return false
		}
		const value = String(text).trim()
		if (value === '') {
			return false
		}
		return /^https?:\/\/\S+$/i.test(value) || /^www\.\S+$/i.test(value)
	}

	function resolveLinkUrlFromObject(obj: any): string {
		if (obj == null || typeof obj !== 'object') {
			return ''
		}
		const direct = obj.url != null ? String(obj.url).trim() : ''
		if (direct !== '') {
			return direct
		}
		const link = obj.link != null ? String(obj.link).trim() : ''
		if (link !== '') {
			return link
		}
		const href = obj.href != null ? String(obj.href).trim() : ''
		if (href !== '') {
			return href
		}
		const nested = obj.content
		if (nested != null) {
			if (typeof nested === 'string') {
				const val = String(nested).trim()
				if (looksLikeLinkContent(val)) {
					return val
				}
			} else if (typeof nested === 'object') {
				const nestedUrl = resolveLinkUrlFromObject(nested)
				if (nestedUrl !== '') {
					return nestedUrl
				}
			}
		}
		return ''
	}

	function isLinkMessage(msg: any): boolean {
		try {
			if (msg == null) {
				return false
			}
			const type = msg.type != null ? String(msg.type) : ''
			if (type === 'text') {
				const raw = msg.content != null ? msg.content : ''
				if (typeof raw === 'string') {
					return looksLikeLinkContent(raw)
				}
				if (raw != null && typeof raw === 'object') {
					const contentText = raw.content != null ? String(raw.content).trim() : ''
					if (looksLikeLinkContent(contentText)) {
						return true
					}
					return resolveLinkUrlFromObject(raw) !== ''
				}
				return false
			}
			if (type !== 'custom') {
				return false
			}
			const parsedContent = parseRawContent(msg.content)
			if (parsedContent != null && typeof parsedContent === 'object') {
				const customType = parsedContent.type != null ? String(parsedContent.type).toUpperCase() : ''
				if (customType === 'LINK' || customType === 'URL' || customType === 'WEB_LINK') {
					return true
				}
				if (resolveLinkUrlFromObject(parsedContent) !== '') {
					return true
				}
			}
			const parsedExtra = parseRawContent((msg as any).extra)
			if (parsedExtra != null && typeof parsedExtra === 'object') {
				const extraType = parsedExtra.type != null ? String(parsedExtra.type).toUpperCase() : ''
				if (extraType === 'LINK' || extraType === 'URL' || extraType === 'WEB_LINK') {
					return true
				}
				if (resolveLinkUrlFromObject(parsedExtra) !== '') {
					return true
				}
			}
			return false
		} catch (e) {
			return false
		}
	}

	function canFavoriteMessageByType(msg: any): boolean {
		try {
			if (msg == null) {
				return false
			}
			const type = msg.type != null ? String(msg.type) : ''
			if (type === 'text' || type === 'image' || type === 'video' || type === 'file') {
				return true
			}
			return isLinkMessage(msg)
		} catch (e) {
			return false
		}
	}

	function resolveStickerCollectCandidate(msg : any) : any | null {
		try {
			if (msg == null) {
				return null
			}
			const type = msg.type != null ? String(msg.type) : ''
			if (type === 'sticker' || type === 'emoji') {
				const fileId = (msg as any).fileId != null ? String((msg as any).fileId) : ''
				const md5 = (msg as any).md5 != null ? String((msg as any).md5) : ''
				const url = msg.content != null ? String(msg.content) : ''
				return {
					stickerId: '',
					fileId: fileId,
					md5: md5,
					url: url
				}
			}
			if (type === 'image') {
				const url = extractMediaUrl(msg.content != null ? msg.content : '')
				return {
					stickerId: '',
					fileId: (msg as any).fileId != null ? String((msg as any).fileId) : '',
					md5: (msg as any).md5 != null ? String((msg as any).md5) : '',
					url: url
				}
			}
			return null
		} catch (e) {
			return null
		}
	}

	function isMessageAlreadyCollectedToSticker(msg : any) : boolean {
		try {
			const candidate = resolveStickerCollectCandidate(msg)
			if (candidate == null) {
				return false
			}
			return hasCollectedSticker(candidate)
		} catch (e) {
			return false
		}
	}

	async function handleVideoPlay(msg : any) {
		try {
			let url = msg && msg.content ? String(msg.content) : ''
			const title = msg && msg.fileName ? String(msg.fileName) : '视频播放'
			if (IM_MEDIA_USE_FILE_ID === 'true' && msg && msg.fileId) {
				const signed = await resolvePresignedUrl(String(msg.fileId))
				if (signed) {
					url = signed
				}
			}
			if (!url) {
				uni.showToast({ title: '视频地址为空', icon: 'none' })
				return
			}
			uni.navigateTo({
				url: `/pages/message/video-player?url=${encodeURIComponent(url)}&title=${encodeURIComponent(title)}`
			})
		} catch (e) {
			console.error('[Chat] 视频播放失败:', e)
			uni.showToast({ title: '播放失败', icon: 'none' })
		}
	}

	async function handleFileOpen(msg : any) {
		try {
			const fileName = msg && msg.fileName ? String(msg.fileName) : ''
			const fileId = msg && msg.fileId != null ? String(msg.fileId) : ''
			const url = msg && msg.content ? String(msg.content) : ''
			navToFilePreview({
				fileId: fileId != '' ? fileId : null,
				url: url != '' ? url : null,
				name: fileName != '' ? fileName : null
			})
		} catch (e) {
			uni.showToast({ title: '打开失败', icon: 'none' })
		}
	}

	function handleLocationOpen(msg : any) {
		try {
			const latVal = msg && msg.latitude != null ? Number(msg.latitude) : NaN
			const lngVal = msg && msg.longitude != null ? Number(msg.longitude) : NaN
			if (isNaN(latVal) || isNaN(lngVal)) {
				uni.showToast({ title: '位置信息缺失', icon: 'none' })
				return
			}
			const address = msg && msg.address != null ? String(msg.address) : ''
			const name = msg && msg.locationName != null ? String(msg.locationName) : address
			uni.showModal({
				title: name !== '' ? name : '位置信息',
				content: address !== '' ? address : '经纬度位置',
				confirmText: '导航',
				cancelText: '取消',
				success: (res) => {
					if (res.confirm !== true) {
						return
					}
					uni.openLocation({
						latitude: latVal,
						longitude: lngVal,
						address: address,
						name: name
					})
				}
			})
		} catch (e) {
			console.error('[Chat] 打开位置失败:', e)
			uni.showToast({ title: '打开失败', icon: 'none' })
		}
	}

	function sendLocationCard(latitude: number, longitude: number, address: string, locationName: string, provider: string): void {
		const safeAddress = address !== '' ? address : (locationName !== '' ? locationName : '位置')
		const safeName = locationName !== '' ? locationName : safeAddress
		const safeProvider = provider !== '' ? provider : 'tencent'
		const message = messageService.sendLocationMessage(
			getReceiverIdForMessage(),
			getGroupIdForMessage(),
			latitude,
			longitude,
			safeAddress,
			safeName,
			safeProvider
		)
		const uiMessage = {
			id: message.id.toString(),
			messageId: message.messageId,
			senderId: message.senderId.toString(),
			receiverId: message.receiverId.toString(),
			type: 'location',
			content: safeAddress,
			address: safeAddress,
			locationName: safeName,
			latitude: latitude,
			longitude: longitude,
			isSelf: true,
			time: new Date(message.timestamp).toLocaleString(),
			timestamp: message.timestamp,
			showTime: true,
			avatarText: message.avatarText,
			avatarBg: message.avatarBg,
			status: message.status
		} as MessageItem
		messages.value.push(uiMessage)
		showPlusMenu.value = false
		setTimeout(() => {
			scrollToBottom()
		}, 100)
	}

	function getContactCardAvatarText(msg: any): string {
		try {
			const name = msg != null && (msg as any).contactDisplayName != null ? String((msg as any).contactDisplayName) : ''
			if (name !== '') {
				return getAvatarTextUtil(name)
			}
		} catch (e) {
		}
		return '名'
	}

	function handleContactCardOpen(msg : any) {
		try {
			const userId = msg && msg.contactUserId != null ? String(msg.contactUserId) : ''
			if (userId === '' || userId === '0') {
				uni.showToast({ title: '名片信息缺失', icon: 'none' })
				return
			}
			const displayName = msg && msg.contactDisplayName != null ? String(msg.contactDisplayName) : ''
			uni.navigateTo({
				url: `/pages/contacts/user-detail?userId=${encodeURIComponent(userId)}&name=${encodeURIComponent(displayName)}`
			})
		} catch (e) {
			console.error('[Chat] 打开名片失败:', e)
			uni.showToast({ title: '打开失败', icon: 'none' })
		}
	}

	async function chooseContactCardAndSend(): Promise<void> {
		if (!ensureConversationWritable()) {
			return
		}
		cleanupContactCardSelectListener()
		contactCardSelectHandler = async (payload: any) => {
			cleanupContactCardSelectListener()
			try {
				await sendContactCard(payload)
			} catch (e) {
				console.error('[Chat] 发送名片失败:', e)
				uni.showToast({ title: '发送失败', icon: 'none' })
			}
		}
		uni.$on(CONTACT_CARD_SELECT_EVENT, contactCardSelectHandler)
		showPlusMenu.value = false
		uni.navigateTo({
			url: '/pages/message/select-contact-card',
			fail: (err) => {
				cleanupContactCardSelectListener()
				console.error('[Chat] 打开名片选择页面失败:', err)
				uni.showToast({ title: '打开失败', icon: 'none' })
			}
		})
	}

	function cleanupContactCardSelectListener(): void {
		try {
			if (contactCardSelectHandler != null) {
				uni.$off(CONTACT_CARD_SELECT_EVENT, contactCardSelectHandler)
			}
		} catch (e) {
			// ignore
		}
		contactCardSelectHandler = null
	}

	async function sendContactCard(contact: any): Promise<void> {
		const payload: any = {
			type: 'CONTACT_CARD',
			userId: contact != null && contact.userId != null ? String(contact.userId) : '',
			displayName: contact != null && contact.displayName != null ? String(contact.displayName) : '',
			deptName: contact != null && contact.deptName != null ? String(contact.deptName) : '',
			postName: contact != null && contact.postName != null ? String(contact.postName) : '',
			avatar: contact != null && contact.avatar != null ? String(contact.avatar) : ''
		}
		if (payload.userId === '' || payload.userId === '0' || payload.displayName === '') {
			uni.showToast({ title: '名片信息无效', icon: 'none' })
			return
		}
		await (messageService as any).sendContactCardMessageByRest(
			chatId.value,
			getReceiverIdForMessage(),
			getGroupIdForMessage(),
			payload
		)
		showPlusMenu.value = false
		setTimeout(() => {
			scrollToBottom()
		}, 100)
	}

		function isWebRuntime(): boolean {
			try {
				const g: any = globalThis as any
				return g != null && g.window != null
			} catch (e) {
				return false
			}
		}

		function getBrowserGeolocation(): Promise<any> {
			return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {
				try {
					const navAny: any = (globalThis as any).navigator
					if (navAny == null || navAny.geolocation == null) {
						reject(new Error('navigator.geolocation not available'))
						return
					}
					navAny.geolocation.getCurrentPosition(
						(position: any) => {
							resolve({
								latitude: position != null && position.coords != null ? Number(position.coords.latitude) : NaN,
								longitude: position != null && position.coords != null ? Number(position.coords.longitude) : NaN
							})
						},
						(error: any) => reject(error),
						{
							enableHighAccuracy: true,
							timeout: 10000,
							maximumAge: 60000
						}
					)
				} catch (e) {
					reject(e)
				}
			})
		}

		async function fallbackSendCurrentLocation(reason: string): Promise<void> {
			try {
				const loc: any = await new Promise((resolve, reject) => {
				uni.getLocation({
					type: 'gcj02',
					success: (res) => resolve(res),
					fail: (err) => reject(err)
				})
			})
			const latitude = loc != null && loc.latitude != null ? Number(loc.latitude) : NaN
			const longitude = loc != null && loc.longitude != null ? Number(loc.longitude) : NaN
			if (isNaN(latitude) || isNaN(longitude)) {
				uni.showToast({ title: '当前位置获取失败', icon: 'none' })
				return
			}
			const name = '当前位置'
				sendLocationCard(latitude, longitude, '', name, 'device')
				uni.showToast({ title: '已发送当前位置', icon: 'success' })
				console.log('[Chat] fallbackSendCurrentLocation success:', { reason: reason })
			} catch (e) {
				console.warn('[Chat] uni.getLocation failed, fallback to browser geolocation:', { reason: reason, e: e })
				if (isWebRuntime()) {
					try {
						const browserLoc: any = await getBrowserGeolocation()
						const latitude = browserLoc != null && browserLoc.latitude != null ? Number(browserLoc.latitude) : NaN
						const longitude = browserLoc != null && browserLoc.longitude != null ? Number(browserLoc.longitude) : NaN
						if (!isNaN(latitude) && !isNaN(longitude)) {
							sendLocationCard(latitude, longitude, '', '当前位置', 'browser')
							uni.showToast({ title: '已发送当前位置', icon: 'success' })
							console.log('[Chat] browser geolocation fallback success:', { reason: reason })
							return
						}
					} catch (browserErr) {
						console.error('[Chat] browser geolocation fallback failed:', { reason: reason, browserErr: browserErr })
					}
				}
				uni.showModal({
					title: '定位失败',
					content: '无法获取当前位置，请检查定位权限后重试。',
					confirmText: '我知道了',
					showCancel: false
				})
			}
		}

    function openMsgMenu(msg : MessageItem, e : TouchEvent) {
        selectedMsg.value = msg
        
        // 优先使用 touchstart 记录的坐标，如果没有则使用 longpress 事件的坐标
        const x = touchStartX.value || (e.touches.length > 0 ? e.touches[0].clientX : 0)
        const y = touchStartY.value || (e.touches.length > 0 ? e.touches[0].clientY : 0)
        
        const systemInfo = uni.getSystemInfoSync()
        const screenWidth = systemInfo.screenWidth
        const screenHeight = systemInfo.screenHeight
        const statusBarHeight = systemInfo.statusBarHeight || 0
        
        // 根据消息类型确定菜单项
        const isVoiceRestricted = msg.type === 'voice'
        const isLocationRestricted = msg.type === 'location'
        const messageId = msg && msg.messageId != null ? String(msg.messageId) : ''
        const canFavoriteMessage = messageId !== '' && messageId !== '0' && canFavoriteMessageByType(msg)
        const canCollectSticker = canAddMessageToSticker(msg)
        const alreadyCollectedSticker = canCollectSticker && isMessageAlreadyCollectedToSticker(msg)
        
        // 基础菜单项
        let menuItems : any[] = []
        
        if (isVoiceRestricted) {
            // 语音消息只显示引用和删除
            menuItems = [
                { key: 'quote', labelKey: 'chat.menu.quote', icon: '\ue6f4' },
                { key: 'delete', labelKey: 'chat.menu.delete', icon: '\ue602' }
            ]
        } else if (isLocationRestricted) {
            // 位置消息保持轻量菜单
            menuItems = [
                { key: 'forward', labelKey: 'chat.menu.forward', icon: '\ue63d' },
                { key: 'quote', labelKey: 'chat.menu.quote', icon: '\ue6f4' },
                { key: 'delete', labelKey: 'chat.menu.delete', icon: '\ue602' }
            ]
        } else {
            // 其他消息类型显示完整菜单
            menuItems = [
                { key: 'copy', labelKey: 'chat.menu.copy', icon: '\ue7cb' },
                { key: 'forward', labelKey: 'chat.menu.forward', icon: '\ue63d' },
                { key: 'delete', labelKey: 'chat.menu.delete', icon: '\ue602' },
                { key: 'favorite_message_add', labelKey: 'chat.menu.favoriteMessage', icon: '\ue83f' },
                { key: 'multi', labelKey: 'chat.menu.multi', icon: '\ue69d' },
                { key: 'quote', labelKey: 'chat.menu.quote', icon: '\ue6f4' }
            ]
        }
        if (!canFavoriteMessage) {
            menuItems = menuItems.filter(item => item.key !== 'favorite_message_add')
        }
        if (canCollectSticker && !alreadyCollectedSticker) {
            const insertIndex = menuItems.findIndex(item => item.key === 'quote')
            const stickerItem = { key: 'favorite_sticker', labelKey: 'chat.menu.favoriteSticker', icon: '\ue607' }
            if (insertIndex > -1) {
                menuItems.splice(insertIndex, 0, stickerItem)
            } else {
                menuItems.push(stickerItem)
            }
        }
        if (msg.type !== 'text') {
            menuItems = menuItems.filter(item => item.key !== 'copy')
        }
        
        // 企业级撤回：仅允许撤回自己发送且在时效窗口内的消息（后端也会兜底校验）
        try {
            const statusVal: any = (msg as any).status
            const isRecalled = statusVal === 6 || statusVal === '6' || statusVal === 'recalled'
            const nowTs = Date.now()
            const msgTs = (msg as any).timestamp != null ? Number((msg as any).timestamp) : 0
            const withinWindow = msgTs > 0 ? (nowTs - msgTs <= recallWindowMs.value) : false
            const canRecall = !!msg.isSelf && !isRecalled && withinWindow && !!msg.messageId && msg.messageId !== '0'
			if (canRecall) {
                const deleteIndex = menuItems.findIndex(item => item.key === 'delete')
                if (deleteIndex > -1) {
                    menuItems.splice(deleteIndex, 0, { key: 'recall', labelKey: 'chat.menu.recall', icon: '\ue643' })
                }
            }
        } catch (e) {
            // ignore
        }
        
        currentMenuItems.value = menuItems
        
        // 菜单尺寸（横向排列，支持换行）
        const menuItemWidth = 70 // 每个菜单项宽度
        const menuItemHeight = 70 // 每个菜单项高度（增加以容纳图标+文字）
        const maxMenuWidth = screenWidth - 20 // 最大宽度，左右各留10px边距
        const itemsPerRow = Math.floor(maxMenuWidth / menuItemWidth) // 每行最多显示的菜单项数
        const actualItemsPerRow = Math.min(itemsPerRow, currentMenuItems.value.length) // 实际每行显示数
        const menuWidth = actualItemsPerRow * menuItemWidth
        const rows = Math.ceil(currentMenuItems.value.length / actualItemsPerRow) // 总行数
        const menuHeight = rows * menuItemHeight
        
        // 头部高度：状态栏 + 导航栏(44px)
        const headerHeight = statusBarHeight + 44
        // 底部输入区域高度（估算）
        const footerHeight = 120
        
        // 可用区域
        const availableTop = headerHeight + 10 // 10px边距
        const availableBottom = screenHeight - footerHeight - 10
        const availableLeft = 10
        const availableRight = screenWidth - menuWidth - 10
        
        // 水平定位：优先显示在触摸点附近，但不超出屏幕
        let finalX = x - menuWidth / 2 // 默认居中对齐触摸点
        if (finalX < availableLeft) {
            finalX = availableLeft
        } else if (finalX > availableRight) {
            finalX = availableRight
        }
        
        // 垂直定位：优先显示在触摸点上方，如果上方空间不足则显示在下方
        let finalY = y - menuHeight - 10 // 默认显示在上方，10px间距
        
        if (finalY < availableTop) {
            // 上方空间不足，显示在下方
            finalY = y + 10
            
            // 如果下方也不够，则尽量显示在可用区域内
            if (finalY + menuHeight > availableBottom) {
                finalY = availableBottom - menuHeight
                // 如果还是不够，则显示在触摸点居中位置
                if (finalY < availableTop) {
                    finalY = y - menuHeight / 2
                    // 最后保底：确保不超出边界
                    if (finalY < availableTop) finalY = availableTop
                    if (finalY + menuHeight > availableBottom) finalY = availableBottom - menuHeight
                }
            }
        }
        
        menuX.value = finalX
        menuY.value = finalY
        showMsgMenu.value = true
        
        // 添加淡入动画
        menuOpacity.value = 0
        setTimeout(() => {
            menuOpacity.value = 1
        }, 10)
    }

    function recordTouchStart(e : TouchEvent) {
        if (e.touches.length > 0) {
            touchStartX.value = e.touches[0].clientX
            touchStartY.value = e.touches[0].clientY
        }
    }

    function closeMsgMenu() {
        menuOpacity.value = 0
        setTimeout(() => {
            showMsgMenu.value = false
        }, 150)
    }

    async function handleMenuAction(action : string) {
        if (selectedMsg.value == null) return
        const msg = selectedMsg.value
        if (action === 'quote' && !ensureConversationWritable()) {
            closeMsgMenu()
            return
        }
        
        try {
            if (action === 'copy') {
                if (msg.type === 'text') {
                    uni.setClipboardData({ data: msg.content })
                } else {
                    uni.showToast({ title: t('chat.menu.copy'), icon: 'none' })
                }
            } else if (action === 'forward') {
                try {
                    const mid = msg && msg.messageId != null ? String(msg.messageId) : ''
                    if (mid === '' || mid === '0') {
                        uni.showToast({ title: '参数错误', icon: 'none' })
                        return
                    }
                    uni.navigateTo({
                        url: `/pages/message/forward-target?messageIds=${encodeURIComponent(mid)}&forwardType=1`
                    })
                } catch (e) {
                    uni.showToast({ title: t('chat.menu.forward'), icon: 'none' })
                }
            } else if (action === 'recall') {
                // 撤回消息
                uni.showModal({
                    title: '提示',
                    content: '确定要撤回这条消息吗？',
                    success: async (res) => {
                        if (res.confirm) {
                            try {
                                if (msg.messageId && msg.messageId !== '0') {
                                    await recallMessage(msg.messageId)
                                }

                                // 乐观更新：与 WS RECALL_NOTIFY 走同一路径（status=6 + reeditContent + 会话更新）
                                // handleNewMessage 监听器会自动刷新 messages.value
                                try {
                                    messageService.applyLocalRecall(chatId.value, msg.messageId)
                                } catch (e) {
                                    // ignore，WS push 到达后自愈
                                }

                                uni.showToast({ title: '已撤回', icon: 'success' })
                            } catch (e) {
                                console.error('[Chat] 撤回消息失败:', e)
                                uni.showToast({ title: '撤回失败', icon: 'none' })
                            }
                        }
                    }
                })
            } else if (action === 'delete') {
                // 删除消息
                uni.showModal({
                    title: '提示',
                    content: '确定要删除这条消息吗？',
                    success: async (res) => {
                        if (res.confirm) {
                            try {
                                if (msg.messageId && msg.messageId !== '0') {
                                    await deleteMessage(msg.messageId)
                                }
                                
                                try {
                                    if (chatId.value && chatId.value !== '' && chatId.value !== '0' && msg.messageId && msg.messageId !== '0') {
                                        messageService.removeMessageFromCache(chatId.value, msg.messageId)
                                    }
                                } catch (e) {
                                    // ignore
                                }
                                
                                // 从本地消息列表中移除
                                const idx = messages.value.findIndex(m => m.id === msg.id)
                                if (idx > -1) {
                                    messages.value.splice(idx, 1)
                                }
                                
                                uni.showToast({ title: '已删除', icon: 'success' })
                            } catch (e) {
                                console.error('[Chat] 删除消息失败:', e)
                                uni.showToast({ title: '删除失败', icon: 'none' })
                            }
                        }
                    }
                })
            } else if (action === 'favorite_message_add') {
                const mid = msg && msg.messageId != null ? String(msg.messageId) : ''
                if (mid === '' || mid === '0') {
                    uni.showToast({ title: '当前消息不可收藏', icon: 'none' })
                    return
                }
                if (!canFavoriteMessageByType(msg)) {
                    uni.showToast({ title: '仅支持收藏文字、图片、链接、视频、文件消息', icon: 'none' })
                    return
                }
                await addMessageFavoriteApi(mid)
                uni.showToast({ title: '已收藏', icon: 'success' })
            } else if (action === 'favorite_sticker') {
                if (!canAddMessageToSticker(msg)) {
                    uni.showToast({ title: '当前消息不可添加', icon: 'none' })
                    return
                }
                if (isMessageAlreadyCollectedToSticker(msg)) {
                    uni.showToast({ title: '已添加到表情', icon: 'none' })
                    return
                }
                if (msg.type !== 'emoji' && (msg.messageId == null || msg.messageId === '' || msg.messageId === '0')) {
                    uni.showToast({ title: '当前消息不可添加', icon: 'none' })
                    return
                }
                if (stickerList.value.length >= STICKER_LIMIT) {
                    uni.showToast({ title: `最多添加${STICKER_LIMIT}张表情`, icon: 'none' })
                    return
                }
                try {
                    if (msg.type === 'emoji') {
                        const emojiPath = msg.content != null ? String(msg.content) : ''
                        if (emojiPath === '') {
                            uni.showToast({ title: '当前表情不可收藏', icon: 'none' })
                            return
                        }
                        const uploadResult = await uploadFileAndReturnId(emojiPath, {
                            directory: `im/sticker/${currentUserId.value}`,
                            showToast: false
                        })
                        const data: any = uploadResult != null ? (uploadResult as any).data : null
                        const addedSticker = await uploadCustomSticker({
                            fileId: data != null && data.fileId != null ? String(data.fileId) : '',
                            url: data != null && data.url != null ? String(data.url) : emojiPath,
                            md5: data != null && data.md5 != null ? String(data.md5) : '',
                            name: 'emoji'
                        })
                        stickerList.value = getCustomStickers()
                        uni.showToast({ title: addedSticker != null && addedSticker.duplicated ? '已在表情库中' : '已添加到表情', icon: 'success' })
                    } else {
                        const addedSticker = await collectMessageToSticker(String(msg.messageId))
                        stickerList.value = getCustomStickers()
                        uni.showToast({ title: addedSticker != null && addedSticker.duplicated ? '已在表情库中' : '已添加到表情', icon: 'success' })
                    }
                } catch (e) {
                    console.error('[Chat] 添加到表情失败', e)
                    uni.showToast({ title: '添加失败', icon: 'none' })
                }
            } else if (action === 'multi') {
                multiSelectMode.value = true
                // 延迟滚动，等待布局更新
                setTimeout(() => {
                    scrollToBottom()
                }, 100)
            } else if (action === 'quote') {
                // 设置引用回复状态
                quoteReplyMsg.value = msg
                // 如果当前是语音模式，切换到文字输入模式
                if (isVoiceMode.value) {
                    isVoiceMode.value = false
                }
            }
        } catch (e) {
            console.error('[Chat] 菜单操作失败:', e)
        }
        
        closeMsgMenu()
    }

	async function openReadReceiptSheet(messageId: string, messageType: string = '') {
		try {
			showReadReceiptSheet.value = true
			readReceiptMessageId.value = messageId
			readReceiptMessageType.value = messageType !== '' ? messageType : resolveMessageTypeByMessageId(messageId)
			readReceiptTab.value = 'read'
			readReceiptList.value = []
			readReceiptPageNo.value = 1
			readReceiptHasMore.value = true
			// 等待一小段时间，确保消息已完全落库，避免返回 null
			await new Promise(resolve => setTimeout(resolve, 200))
			readReceiptSummary.value = await readReceiptService.getSummary(messageId)
			if (readReceiptSummary.value == null) {
				// 如果仍为 null，显示提示并关闭面板
				uni.showToast({ title: '数据加载中，请稍后再试', icon: 'none' })
				showReadReceiptSheet.value = false
				return
			}
			if (readReceiptMessageType.value === '') {
				readReceiptMessageType.value = resolveReadReceiptMessageTypeFromSummary(readReceiptSummary.value)
			}
			try {
				const next: Record<string, { summary: any | null; fetchedAt: number }> = {}
				Object.assign(next, readReceiptSummaryCache.value)
				next[messageId] = { summary: readReceiptSummary.value, fetchedAt: Date.now() }
				readReceiptSummaryCache.value = next
				pruneReadReceiptSummaryCache()
			} catch (e) {
				// ignore
			}
			await reloadReadReceiptList()
		} catch (e) {
			console.error('[Chat] openReadReceiptSheet failed:', e)
			uni.showToast({ title: '加载失败', icon: 'none' })
		}
	}

	function getCachedReadReceiptSummary(messageId: string): { summary: any | null; fetchedAt: number } | null {
		try {
			const cache = readReceiptSummaryCache.value
			const item = cache && cache[messageId] ? cache[messageId] : null
			return item ? item : null
		} catch (e) {
			return null
		}
	}

	function pruneReadReceiptSummaryCache(): void {
		try {
			const cache = readReceiptSummaryCache.value
			if (!cache) return
			const now = Date.now()
			const keys = Object.keys(cache)
			if (keys.length === 0) return

			const entries: Array<{ id: string; fetchedAt: number; item: { summary: any | null; fetchedAt: number } }> = []
			for (let i = 0; i < keys.length; i++) {
				const id = keys[i]
				const it = cache[id]
				if (!it) continue
				const age = now - (it.fetchedAt || 0)
				if (age <= READ_RECEIPT_SUMMARY_TTL_MS) {
					entries.push({ id, fetchedAt: it.fetchedAt || 0, item: it })
				}
			}

			// if nothing pruned by ttl and under size limit, keep as-is
			if (entries.length === keys.length && entries.length <= READ_RECEIPT_SUMMARY_CACHE_MAX) {
				return
			}

			entries.sort((a, b) => b.fetchedAt - a.fetchedAt)
			const kept = entries.slice(0, READ_RECEIPT_SUMMARY_CACHE_MAX)
			const next: Record<string, { summary: any | null; fetchedAt: number }> = {}
			for (let i = 0; i < kept.length; i++) {
				next[kept[i].id] = kept[i].item
			}
			readReceiptSummaryCache.value = next
		} catch (e) {
			// ignore
		}
	}

	function resolveReadReceiptTargetMessageId(msg: any): string {
		try {
			const messageId = msg != null && msg.messageId != null ? String(msg.messageId) : ''
			if (messageId !== '' && messageId !== '0' && /^\d+$/.test(messageId)) {
				return messageId
			}
			const id = msg != null && msg.id != null ? String(msg.id) : ''
			if (id !== '' && id !== '0' && /^\d+$/.test(id)) {
				return id
			}
			if (messageId !== '' && messageId !== '0') {
				return messageId
			}
			return id !== '0' ? id : ''
		} catch (e) {
			return ''
		}
	}

	function shouldFetchReadReceiptSummary(messageId: string): boolean {
		try {
			const cached = getCachedReadReceiptSummary(messageId)
			if (!cached) return true
			const age = Date.now() - (cached.fetchedAt || 0)
			return age > READ_RECEIPT_SUMMARY_TTL_MS
		} catch (e) {
			return true
		}
	}

	function markReadReceiptSummaryInFlight(messageId: string, inFlight: boolean) {
		try {
			const next: Record<string, boolean> = {}
			Object.assign(next, readReceiptSummaryInFlight.value)
			if (inFlight) {
				next[messageId] = true
			} else {
				try {
					delete next[messageId]
				} catch (e) {
					// ignore
				}
			}
			readReceiptSummaryInFlight.value = next
		} catch (e) {
			// ignore
		}
	}

	function isReadReceiptSummaryInFlight(messageId: string): boolean {
		try {
			return !!(readReceiptSummaryInFlight.value && readReceiptSummaryInFlight.value[messageId])
		} catch (e) {
			return false
		}
	}

	function getReadReceiptSummaryRetryCount(messageId: string): number {
		try {
			if (!messageId) return 0
			const raw = readReceiptSummaryRetryCount.value && readReceiptSummaryRetryCount.value[messageId]
			return raw != null ? Number(raw) : 0
		} catch (e) {
			return 0
		}
	}

	function setReadReceiptSummaryRetryCount(messageId: string, count: number) {
		try {
			if (!messageId) return
			const next: Record<string, number> = {}
			Object.assign(next, readReceiptSummaryRetryCount.value)
			if (count > 0) {
				next[messageId] = count
			} else {
				try {
					delete next[messageId]
				} catch (e) {
				}
			}
			readReceiptSummaryRetryCount.value = next
		} catch (e) {
		}
	}

	function scheduleReadReceiptSummaryRetry(messageId: string, attempt: number) {
		try {
			if (!messageId || attempt > 3) return
			const delay = attempt === 1 ? 600 : (attempt === 2 ? 1500 : 3000)
			setTimeout(() => {
				try {
					ensureReadReceiptSummaryFetched(messageId)
				} catch (e) {
				}
			}, delay)
		} catch (e) {
		}
	}

	function ensureReadReceiptSummaryFetched(messageId: string) {
		try {
			if (!messageId) return
			if (!shouldFetchReadReceiptSummary(messageId)) return
			if (isReadReceiptSummaryInFlight(messageId)) return
			markReadReceiptSummaryInFlight(messageId, true)
			Promise.resolve().then(async () => {
				try {
					const summary = await readReceiptService.getSummary(messageId)
					if (summary != null) {
						setReadReceiptSummaryRetryCount(messageId, 0)
						const next: Record<string, { summary: any | null; fetchedAt: number }> = {}
						Object.assign(next, readReceiptSummaryCache.value)
						next[messageId] = { summary, fetchedAt: Date.now() }
						readReceiptSummaryCache.value = next
						pruneReadReceiptSummaryCache()
					} else {
						const nextAttempt = getReadReceiptSummaryRetryCount(messageId) + 1
						setReadReceiptSummaryRetryCount(messageId, nextAttempt)
						if (nextAttempt <= 3) {
							scheduleReadReceiptSummaryRetry(messageId, nextAttempt)
						} else {
							const next: Record<string, { summary: any | null; fetchedAt: number }> = {}
							Object.assign(next, readReceiptSummaryCache.value)
							next[messageId] = { summary: null, fetchedAt: Date.now() }
							readReceiptSummaryCache.value = next
							pruneReadReceiptSummaryCache()
						}
					}
				} catch (e) {
					// ignore
				} finally {
					markReadReceiptSummaryInFlight(messageId, false)
				}
			})
		} catch (e) {
			// ignore
		}
	}

	function shouldShowReadReceiptEntry(msg: any): boolean {
		try {
			if (chatType.value !== 'group') return false
			if (!msg || !msg.isSelf) return false
			if (resolveReadReceiptTargetMessageId(msg) === '') return false
			// Only show after the server has confirmed the message.
			if (!isMsgConfirmedSent(msg)) return false
			return true
		} catch (e) {
			return false
		}
	}

	function buildReadReceiptEntryText(msg: any): string {
		try {
			const mid = resolveReadReceiptTargetMessageId(msg)
			if (!mid) return '统计中'
			const cached = getCachedReadReceiptSummary(mid)
			if (cached && cached.summary) {
				const s: any = cached.summary
				const unread = s.unreadCount != null ? Number(s.unreadCount) : 0
				if (unread > 0) {
					return `未读${unread}`
				}
				return '已读'
			}
			ensureReadReceiptSummaryFetched(mid)
			return '统计中'
		} catch (e) {
			return '统计中'
		}
	}

	function prefetchVisibleGroupReadReceiptSummary(list: MessageItem[]) {
		try {
			if (chatType.value !== 'group' || !list || list.length === 0) return
			const latest = list.slice(Math.max(0, list.length - 20))
			for (let i = 0; i < latest.length; i++) {
				const msg: any = latest[i]
				const readReceiptMessageId = resolveReadReceiptTargetMessageId(msg)
				if (shouldShowReadReceiptEntry(msg) && readReceiptMessageId !== '') {
					ensureReadReceiptSummaryFetched(readReceiptMessageId)
				}
			}
		} catch (e) {
			// ignore
		}
	}

	async function handleReadReceiptEntryClick(msg: any) {
		try {
			const readReceiptMessageId = resolveReadReceiptTargetMessageId(msg)
			if (!msg || readReceiptMessageId === '') return
			if (!isMsgConfirmedSent(msg)) {
				uni.showToast({ title: '发送中', icon: 'none' })
				return
			}
			const messageType = msg != null && (msg as any).type != null ? String((msg as any).type) : ''
			await openReadReceiptSheet(readReceiptMessageId, messageType)
		} catch (e) {
			// ignore
		}
	}

	function closeReadReceiptSheet() {
		showReadReceiptSheet.value = false
		readReceiptList.value = []
		readReceiptSummary.value = null
		readReceiptHasMore.value = true
		readReceiptLoading.value = false
		readReceiptMessageId.value = ''
		readReceiptMessageType.value = ''
	}

	async function switchReadReceiptTab(tab: 'read' | 'unread') {
		if (readReceiptTab.value === tab) {
			return
		}
		readReceiptTab.value = tab
		await reloadReadReceiptList()
	}

	async function reloadReadReceiptList() {
		readReceiptList.value = []
		readReceiptPageNo.value = 1
		readReceiptHasMore.value = true
		await loadMoreReadReceipt()
	}

	async function loadMoreReadReceipt() {
		if (!showReadReceiptSheet.value) {
			return
		}
		if (readReceiptLoading.value || !readReceiptHasMore.value) {
			return
		}
		if (!readReceiptMessageId.value) {
			return
		}
		readReceiptLoading.value = true
		try {
			const page = await readReceiptService.getDetailPage(readReceiptMessageId.value, readReceiptTab.value, readReceiptPageNo.value, readReceiptPageSize)
			const list = page && page.list ? page.list : []
			readReceiptList.value = readReceiptList.value.concat(list)
			const loaded = readReceiptList.value.length
			const total = page && page.total != null ? page.total : loaded
			readReceiptHasMore.value = loaded < total
			if (list.length > 0) {
				readReceiptPageNo.value = readReceiptPageNo.value + 1
			} else {
				readReceiptHasMore.value = false
			}
		} catch (e) {
			console.error('[Chat] loadMoreReadReceipt failed:', e)
			readReceiptHasMore.value = false
		} finally {
			readReceiptLoading.value = false
		}
	}

	function formatReadReceiptTime(ts: number): string {
		try {
			if (!ts || ts <= 0) {
				return ''
			}
			const d = new Date(ts)
			const now = new Date()
			const diff = now.getTime() - d.getTime()
			if (diff >= 0 && diff < 60 * 1000) {
				return '刚刚'
			}
			if (isSameDay(d, now)) {
				return '今天 ' + formatHHmm(d)
			}
			const y = new Date(now.getTime() - 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000)
			if (isSameDay(d, y)) {
				return '昨天 ' + formatHHmm(d)
			}
			return formatYYYYMMDDHHmm(d)
		} catch (e) {
			return ''
		}
	}

	function pad2(n: number): string {
		return n < 10 ? '0' + n : String(n)
	}

	function formatHHmm(d: Date): string {
		return pad2(d.getHours()) + ':' + pad2(d.getMinutes())
	}

	function formatYYYYMMDDHHmm(d: Date): string {
		const yyyy = d.getFullYear()
		const mm = pad2(d.getMonth() + 1)
		const dd = pad2(d.getDate())
		return `${yyyy}-${mm}-${dd} ${formatHHmm(d)}`
	}

	function isSameDay(a: Date, b: Date): boolean {
		return a.getFullYear() === b.getFullYear() && a.getMonth() === b.getMonth() && a.getDate() === b.getDate()
	}

	function getReadReceiptAvatarText(item: any): string {
		try {
			const name = (item && item.userName ? String(item.userName) : '').trim()
			if (name) {
				return getAvatarTextUtil(name)
			}
			const id = item && item.userId != null ? String(item.userId) : ''
			return id ? id.substring(Math.max(0, id.length - 2)) : '?'
		} catch (e) {
			return '?'
		}
	}

	function getReadReceiptAvatarBg(item: any): string {
		try {
			const id = item && item.userId != null ? String(item.userId) : '0'
			return getUserAvatarColor(id)
		} catch (e) {
			return '#8F959E'
		}
	}


    function toggleSelect(msg : MessageItem) {
		const id = getSelectMessageId(msg)
		if (id === '') {
			uni.showToast({ title: '参数错误', icon: 'none' })
			return
		}
		const idx = selectedIds.value.indexOf(id)
        if (idx > -1) {
            selectedIds.value.splice(idx, 1)
        } else {
			if (selectedIds.value.length >= MAX_FORWARD_MESSAGE_COUNT) {
				uni.showToast({ title: `最多选择 ${MAX_FORWARD_MESSAGE_COUNT} 条消息`, icon: 'none' })
				return
			}
			selectedIds.value.push(id)
        }
    }

	function getSelectMessageId(msg: MessageItem): string {
		try {
			const mid = (msg as any) && (msg as any).messageId != null ? String((msg as any).messageId) : ''
			if (mid !== '' && mid !== '0') {
				return mid
			}
			const id = msg && (msg as any).id != null ? String((msg as any).id) : ''
			return id !== '0' ? id : ''
		} catch (e) {
			return ''
		}
	}

	function getMessageRenderKey(msg: MessageItem, index: number): string {
		try {
			const messageId = msg && (msg as any).messageId != null ? String((msg as any).messageId) : ''
			if (messageId !== '' && messageId !== '0') {
				return 'mid-' + messageId
			}
			const localId = msg && (msg as any).id != null ? String((msg as any).id) : ''
			if (localId !== '' && localId !== '0') {
				return 'id-' + localId
			}
			const sequence = msg && (msg as any).sequence != null ? String((msg as any).sequence) : ''
			if (sequence !== '' && sequence !== '0') {
				return 'seq-' + sequence
			}
			const timestamp = msg && (msg as any).timestamp != null ? String((msg as any).timestamp) : '0'
			return 'idx-' + index + '-' + timestamp
		} catch (e) {
			return 'idx-' + index
		}
	}

	function safeParseJson(raw: any): any | null {
		try {
			if (raw == null) {
				return null
			}
			if (typeof raw === 'string') {
				const s = raw.trim()
				if (s === '') {
					return null
				}
				if (s === '[object Object]' || s === '[object UTSJSONObject]' || s === '[object Array]') {
					return null
				}
				const first = s.charAt(0)
				const last = s.charAt(s.length - 1)
				const couldBeJsonObject = first === '{' && last === '}'
				const couldBeJsonArray = first === '[' && last === ']'
				if (!couldBeJsonObject && !couldBeJsonArray) {
					return null
				}
				if (couldBeJsonArray) {
					const inner = s.substring(1, s.length - 1).trim()
					if (inner !== '') {
						const c0 = inner.charAt(0)
						const isLikelyJsonArray =
							c0 === '{' || c0 === '[' || c0 === '"' || c0 === '-' ||
							(c0 >= '0' && c0 <= '9') || c0 === 't' || c0 === 'f' || c0 === 'n'
						if (!isLikelyJsonArray) {
							return null
						}
					}
				}
				return JSON.parse(s)
			}
			if (typeof raw === 'object') {
				return raw
			}
			return null
		} catch (e) {
			return null
		}
	}

	function getForwardCombineBody(msg: MessageItem): any | null {
		try {
			const mid = msg && (msg as any).messageId != null ? String((msg as any).messageId) : ''
			const key = mid !== '' ? mid : (msg && (msg as any).id != null ? String((msg as any).id) : '')
			if (key !== '' && forwardCombineCache.has(key)) {
				const cached = forwardCombineCache.get(key) as any
				if (cached != null && cached.type != null && String(cached.type) === 'FORWARD_COMBINE') {
					return cached
				}
				forwardCombineCache.delete(key)
			}
			const raw = (msg as any).content
			let body = safeParseJson(raw)
			if (body != null && body.type != null && String(body.type) === 'FORWARD_COMBINE') {
				if (key !== '') {
					forwardCombineCache.set(key, body)
				}
				return body
			}
			if (body != null && (body as any).content != null) {
				const nested = safeParseJson((body as any).content)
				if (nested != null && nested.type != null && String(nested.type) === 'FORWARD_COMBINE') {
					body = nested
				}
			}
			if (body != null && (body as any).body != null) {
				const nested = safeParseJson((body as any).body)
				if (nested != null && nested.type != null && String(nested.type) === 'FORWARD_COMBINE') {
					body = nested
				}
			}
			if (key !== '' && body != null && body.type != null && String(body.type) === 'FORWARD_COMBINE') {
				forwardCombineCache.set(key, body)
			} else if (key !== '') {
				forwardCombineCache.delete(key)
			}
			return body
		} catch (e) {
			return null
		}
	}

	function isForwardCombineMsg(msg: MessageItem): boolean {
		const body = getForwardCombineBody(msg)
		return body != null && body.type != null && String(body.type) === 'FORWARD_COMBINE'
	}

	function getForwardCombineComment(msg: MessageItem): string {
		const body = getForwardCombineBody(msg)
		const c = body != null && body.comment != null ? String(body.comment) : ''
		return c
	}

	function buildForwardCombineLine(item: any): string {
		try {
			const senderName = item != null && item.senderName != null ? String(item.senderName) : ''
			const mt = item != null && item.messageType != null ? Number(item.messageType) : 0
			const typeStr = getMessageTypeString(mt)
			let preview = ''
			if (typeStr === 'text' || typeStr === 'quote') {
				const raw = item != null ? item.content : null
				const parsed = safeParseJson(raw)
				if (parsed != null && typeof parsed === 'object') {
					if ((parsed as any).replyContent != null && String((parsed as any).replyContent) !== '') {
						preview = String((parsed as any).replyContent)
					} else if ((parsed as any).content != null && String((parsed as any).content) !== '') {
						preview = String((parsed as any).content)
					} else {
						preview = '[消息]'
					}
				} else {
					preview = raw != null ? String(raw) : ''
				}
			} else if (typeStr === 'custom') {
				const body = safeParseJson(item != null ? item.content : null)
				if (body != null && body.type != null && String(body.type) === 'FORWARD_COMBINE') {
					preview = '[聊天记录]'
				} else if (body != null && body.type != null && String(body.type) === 'STICKER') {
					preview = '[动画表情]'
				} else if (body != null && body.type != null && String(body.type) === 'CONTACT_CARD') {
					preview = '[名片]'
				} else {
					preview = '[消息]'
				}
			} else if (typeStr === 'contact_card') {
				preview = '[名片]'
			} else if (typeStr === 'image') {
				preview = '[图片]'
			} else if (typeStr === 'video') {
				preview = '[视频]'
			} else if (typeStr === 'voice') {
				preview = '[语音]'
			} else if (typeStr === 'file') {
				preview = '[文件]'
			} else if (typeStr === 'location') {
				preview = '[位置]'
			} else {
				preview = '[消息]'
			}
			if (senderName !== '') {
				return `${senderName}：${preview}`
			}
			return preview
		} catch (e) {
			return '[消息]'
		}
	}

	function getForwardCombinePreviewLines(msg: MessageItem): string[] {
		const body = getForwardCombineBody(msg)
		const arr: any[] = body != null && body.messages != null ? (body.messages as any[]) : []
		const lines: string[] = []
		const max = arr.length > 3 ? 3 : arr.length
		for (let i = 0; i < max; i++) {
			lines.push(buildForwardCombineLine(arr[i]))
		}
		return lines
	}

	function handleOpenForwardCombine(msg: MessageItem): void {
		try {
			const mid = getSelectMessageId(msg)
			if (mid === '') {
				uni.showToast({ title: '无法打开', icon: 'none' })
				return
			}
			uni.navigateTo({
				url: `/pages/message/forward-combine-detail?messageId=${encodeURIComponent(mid)}`
			})
		} catch (e) {
			uni.showToast({ title: '无法打开', icon: 'none' })
		}
	}

    /**
     * 清除引用回复状态
     */
    function clearQuoteReply() {
        quoteReplyMsg.value = null
    }

    /**
     * 定位到被引用的消息
     */
    async function scrollToQuotedMessage(quoteMessageId: string) {
		if (quoteMessageId == null || quoteMessageId === '' || quoteMessageId === '0') {
			uni.showToast({ title: '原消息已不存在', icon: 'none' })
			return
		}
        let index = findMessageIndexForTargetId(String(quoteMessageId))
		if (index === -1) {
			const foundAfterLoad = await loadAnchorWindow(null, String(quoteMessageId))
			if (!foundAfterLoad) {
				return
			}
			index = findMessageIndexForTargetId(String(quoteMessageId))
		}
        if (index !== -1) {
            highlightedMessageId.value = getSelectMessageId(messages.value[index])
            lastMessageId.value = 'msg-' + index
            setTimeout(() => {
                highlightedMessageId.value = ''
            }, 3000)
        } else {
            uni.showToast({ title: '原消息已不存在', icon: 'none' })
        }
    }

    function handleBubbleClick(msg : MessageItem) {
        if (multiSelectMode.value) {
            toggleSelect(msg)
        }
    }

    function exitMultiSelectMode() {
        multiSelectMode.value = false
        selectedIds.value = []
        // 延迟滚动，等待布局更新
        setTimeout(() => {
            scrollToBottom()
        }, 100)
    }

    function handleMultiForward() {
        if (selectedIds.value.length === 0) {
            uni.showToast({ title: '请选择要转发的消息', icon: 'none' })
            return
        }
        // 显示转发确认对话框
        showForwardConfirm.value = true
    }

    function cancelForward() {
        showForwardConfirm.value = false
    }

    function confirmForward() {
        openForwardTargetSelector()
    }

    function openForwardTargetSelector() {
        try {
            const ids = selectedIds.value != null ? selectedIds.value : []
            const filtered = ids.filter(id => id != null && id !== '' && id !== '0')
            if (filtered.length === 0) {
                uni.showToast({ title: '请选择要转发的消息', icon: 'none' })
                return
            }
			if (filtered.length > MAX_FORWARD_MESSAGE_COUNT) {
				uni.showToast({ title: `最多选择 ${MAX_FORWARD_MESSAGE_COUNT} 条消息`, icon: 'none' })
				return
			}
            const qs = filtered.map(id => String(id)).join(',')
            showForwardConfirm.value = false
            exitMultiSelectMode()
            uni.navigateTo({
                url: `/pages/message/forward-target?messageIds=${encodeURIComponent(qs)}&forwardType=1`
            })
        } catch (e) {
            uni.showToast({ title: '打开失败', icon: 'none' })
        }
    }

    function handleMultiDelete() {
        if (selectedIds.value.length === 0) {
            uni.showToast({ title: '请选择要删除的消息', icon: 'none' })
            return
        }
        uni.showModal({
            title: '提示',
            content: `确定删除选中的 ${selectedIds.value.length} 条消息吗？`,
            success: (res) => {
                if (res.confirm) {
                    // 删除选中的消息
                    messages.value = messages.value.filter(m => !selectedIds.value.includes(m.id))
                    exitMultiSelectMode()
                    uni.showToast({ title: '删除成功', icon: 'success' })
                }
            }
        })
    }

	/**
	 * 计算语音气泡宽度（对齐微信风格：时长越长越宽，增长曲线逐段放缓）
	 */
	function getVoiceBubbleWidth(duration : number, hasStatus: boolean = false) : string {
		const minWidth = hasStatus ? 108 : 72
		const maxWidth = 238
		const safeDuration = Math.max(1, Math.min(60, Math.round(Number(duration) || 1)))
		let width = minWidth
		if (safeDuration <= 10) {
			// 前 10 秒增长更明显，让 1s/5s/10s 有清晰层级
			width = minWidth + (safeDuration - 1) * 5.4
		} else if (safeDuration <= 30) {
			// 10~30 秒线性增长
			width = minWidth + 9 * 5.4 + (safeDuration - 10) * 2.8
		} else {
			// 30~60 秒继续增长但放缓，避免超长气泡挤压布局
			width = minWidth + 9 * 5.4 + 20 * 2.8 + (safeDuration - 30) * 1.9
		}
		if (width < minWidth) {
			width = minWidth
		}
		if (width > maxWidth) {
			width = maxWidth
		}
		return `${Math.round(width)}px`
	}

	function patchMessageInList(messageId: string, patch: any): void {
		if (messageId == null || messageId === '') {
			return
		}
		const idx = messages.value.findIndex((item: any) => item != null && item.messageId === messageId)
		if (idx < 0) {
			return
		}
		const next: any = {
			...messages.value[idx],
			...patch
		}
		messages.value.splice(idx, 1, next as MessageItem)
	}

	function removeMessageFromList(messageId: string): void {
		if (messageId == null || messageId === '') {
			return
		}
		const idx = messages.value.findIndex((item: any) => item != null && item.messageId === messageId)
		if (idx >= 0) {
			messages.value.splice(idx, 1)
		}
	}

	async function ensureVoiceUploadScopeReady(showError: boolean = true): Promise<boolean> {
		if (chatType.value === 'group') {
			const gid = targetId.value != null && targetId.value !== '' ? targetId.value : groupId.value
			if (gid != null && gid !== '' && gid !== '0') {
				return true
			}
			if (showError) {
				uni.showToast({ title: '群会话信息未就绪', icon: 'none' })
			}
			return false
		}
		if (chatId.value != null && chatId.value !== '' && chatId.value !== '0') {
			return true
		}
		const target = targetId.value != null ? targetId.value : ''
		if (target === '' || target === '0') {
			if (showError) {
				uni.showToast({ title: '会话信息未就绪', icon: 'none' })
			}
			return false
		}
		if (voiceScopeResolvePromise != null) {
			return await voiceScopeResolvePromise
		}
		voiceScopeResolvePromise = Promise.resolve().then(async () => {
			try {
				const conversationResult = await getConversationByTarget(target, 1)
				const resolvedChatId = conversationResult && (conversationResult.chatId != null ? conversationResult.chatId : conversationResult.id)
				const normalizedChatId = resolvedChatId != null ? resolvedChatId.toString() : ''
				if (normalizedChatId === '' || normalizedChatId === '0') {
					throw new Error('chatId 为空')
				}
				chatId.value = normalizedChatId
				try {
					messageService.setActiveChatId(normalizedChatId)
				} catch (e) {
					// ignore
				}
				return true
			} catch (e) {
				console.error('[Chat] 初始化语音会话作用域失败:', e)
				if (showError) {
					uni.showToast({ title: '会话初始化失败，请稍后重试', icon: 'none' })
				}
				return false
			} finally {
				voiceScopeResolvePromise = null
			}
		})
		return await voiceScopeResolvePromise
	}

	function buildVoiceUploadDirectory(): string {
		if (chatType.value === 'group') {
			const gid = targetId.value != null && targetId.value !== '' ? targetId.value : groupId.value
			return `im/group/${gid || '0'}/voice`
		}
		const cid = chatId.value != null && chatId.value !== '' ? chatId.value : '0'
		return `im/chat/${cid || '0'}/voice`
	}

	function resolveVoiceMessageId(msg: any): string {
		if (msg == null) {
			return ''
		}
		const messageId = (msg as any).messageId != null ? String((msg as any).messageId) : ''
		if (messageId !== '' && messageId !== '0') {
			return messageId
		}
		const id = (msg as any).id != null ? String((msg as any).id) : ''
		return id !== '0' ? id : ''
	}

	function isVoicePlaying(msg: any): boolean {
		const messageId = resolveVoiceMessageId(msg)
		return messageId !== '' && activePlayingVoiceMessageId.value === messageId
	}

	function isVoicePaused(msg: any): boolean {
		const messageId = resolveVoiceMessageId(msg)
		return messageId !== ''
			&& activePausedVoiceMessageId.value === messageId
			&& activePlayingVoiceMessageId.value !== messageId
	}

	function shouldShowVoicePauseButton(msg: any): boolean {
		if (msg == null || isVoiceUploading(msg) || isVoiceUploadFailed(msg) || isVoiceSendFailed(msg)) {
			return false
		}
		return isVoicePlaying(msg)
	}

	function shouldShowVoiceResumeButton(msg: any): boolean {
		if (msg == null || isVoiceUploading(msg) || isVoiceUploadFailed(msg) || isVoiceSendFailed(msg)) {
			return false
		}
		return isVoicePaused(msg)
	}

	function buildVoiceWaveBarHeights(msg: any): number[] {
		if (!isVoicePlaying(msg)) {
			return [5, 9, 6]
		}
		const frameIndex = activePlayingWaveFrameIndex.value % VOICE_PLAY_WAVE_FRAMES.length
		if (frameIndex < 0 || frameIndex >= VOICE_PLAY_WAVE_FRAMES.length) {
			return [5, 9, 6]
		}
		return VOICE_PLAY_WAVE_FRAMES[frameIndex]
	}

	function buildRecordingWaveHeights(): number[] {
		const level = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, recordingInputLevel.value))
		const dynamicHeight = Math.round(level * 20)
		const pulse = recordingWaveSeed.value % 4
		const heights: number[] = []
		for (let i = 0; i < RECORDING_WAVE_BASE_HEIGHTS.length; i++) {
			const base = RECORDING_WAVE_BASE_HEIGHTS[i]
			const pulseExtra = pulse === (i % 4) ? 2 : 0
			const rate = i % 2 === 0 ? 0.55 : 0.85
			heights.push(base + Math.round(dynamicHeight * rate) + pulseExtra)
		}
		return heights
	}

	function startPlaybackWaveAnimation(): void {
		if (playbackWaveTimer != null) {
			return
		}
		playbackWaveTimer = setInterval(() => {
			activePlayingWaveFrameIndex.value = (activePlayingWaveFrameIndex.value + 1) % VOICE_PLAY_WAVE_FRAMES.length
		}, 180)
	}

	function stopPlaybackWaveAnimation(): void {
		if (playbackWaveTimer != null) {
			clearInterval(playbackWaveTimer)
			playbackWaveTimer = null
		}
		activePlayingWaveFrameIndex.value = 0
	}

	function startRecordingWaveAnimation(): void {
		if (recordingWaveTimer != null) {
			return
		}
		recordingWaveTimer = setInterval(() => {
			recordingWaveSeed.value = (recordingWaveSeed.value + 1) % 1000
		}, 120)
	}

	function stopRecordingWaveAnimation(): void {
		if (recordingWaveTimer != null) {
			clearInterval(recordingWaveTimer)
			recordingWaveTimer = null
		}
		recordingWaveSeed.value = 0
	}

	function syncVoiceDurationFromPlayback(msg: any, durationSecFromPlayback: number): void {
		if (durationSecFromPlayback <= 0 || durationSecFromPlayback > 3600) {
			return
		}
		const messageId = resolveVoiceMessageId(msg)
		if (messageId === '') {
			return
		}
		const durationMs = Math.max(1000, Math.round(durationSecFromPlayback * 1000))
		const durationSec = Math.max(1, Math.round(durationMs / 1000))
		patchMessageInList(messageId, {
			duration: durationSec,
			durationMs: durationMs
		})
	}

	function refreshVoicePlaybackProgressFromContext(messageId: string): void {
		if (voiceAudioContext == null || messageId === '') {
			return
		}
		if (activeVoiceContextMessageId !== '' && activeVoiceContextMessageId !== messageId) {
			return
		}
		let currentMs = 0
		try {
			const rawCurrentSec = Number((voiceAudioContext as any).currentTime || 0)
			currentMs = rawCurrentSec > 0 ? Math.round(rawCurrentSec * 1000) : 0
		} catch (e) {
			currentMs = 0
		}
		try {
			const rawDurationSec = Number((voiceAudioContext as any).duration || 0)
			if (rawDurationSec > 0 && rawDurationSec <= 3600) {
				activeVoicePlaybackDurationMs.value = Math.max(1000, Math.round(rawDurationSec * 1000))
			}
		} catch (e) {
			// ignore
		}
		const durationMs = activeVoicePlaybackDurationMs.value > 0 ? Number(activeVoicePlaybackDurationMs.value) : 1000
		const safeDuration = Math.max(1000, durationMs)
		const safeProgress = Math.max(0, Math.min(safeDuration, currentMs))
		activeVoicePlaybackProgressMs.value = safeProgress
	}

	function clearVoicePlaybackState(): void {
		activePlayingVoiceMessageId.value = ''
		activePausedVoiceMessageId.value = ''
		activeVoicePlaybackProgressMs.value = 0
		activeVoicePlaybackDurationMs.value = 0
		activeVoiceContextMessageId = ''
		stopPlaybackWaveAnimation()
	}

	function releaseVoicePlaybackContext(): void {
		clearVoicePlaybackState()
		const ctx = voiceAudioContext
		voiceAudioContext = null
		if (ctx) {
			try {
				ctx.destroy && ctx.destroy()
			} catch (e) {
				// ignore
			}
		}
	}

	function resolveMessageTypeByMessageId(messageId: string): string {
		if (messageId == null || messageId === '' || messageId === '0') {
			return ''
		}
		try {
			const hit = messages.value.find((item: any) => {
				if (item == null) {
					return false
				}
				const mid = item.messageId != null ? String(item.messageId) : ''
				const id = item.id != null ? String(item.id) : ''
				return mid === messageId || id === messageId
			})
			if (hit != null && (hit as any).type != null) {
				return String((hit as any).type)
			}
		} catch (e) {
			// ignore
		}
		return ''
	}

	function shouldShowVoiceReadReceiptHint(): boolean {
		if (!showReadReceiptSheet.value) {
			return false
		}
		if (readReceiptMessageType.value === 'voice') {
			return true
		}
		return resolveReadReceiptMessageTypeFromSummary(readReceiptSummary.value) === 'voice'
	}

	function resolveReadReceiptMessageTypeFromSummary(summary: any): string {
		try {
			if (summary == null || (summary as any).messageType == null) {
				return ''
			}
			const rawType: any = (summary as any).messageType
			if (rawType === '' || rawType === 0 || rawType === '0') {
				return ''
			}
			return getMessageTypeString(rawType)
		} catch (e) {
			return ''
		}
	}

	function stopCurrentVoicePlayback(): void {
		clearVoicePlaybackState()
		const ctx = voiceAudioContext
		voiceAudioContext = null
		if (ctx) {
			try {
				ctx.stop()
				ctx.destroy && ctx.destroy()
			} catch (e) {
				// ignore
			}
		}
	}

	function pauseCurrentVoicePlayback(messageId: string): void {
		if (voiceAudioContext == null || messageId === '' || activePlayingVoiceMessageId.value !== messageId) {
			return
		}
		try {
			refreshVoicePlaybackProgressFromContext(messageId)
			activePlayingVoiceMessageId.value = ''
			activePausedVoiceMessageId.value = messageId
			stopPlaybackWaveAnimation()
			voiceAudioContext.pause()
		} catch (e) {
			console.error('[Chat] 暂停语音失败:', e)
			releaseVoicePlaybackContext()
		}
	}

	function isVoiceUploading(msg: any): boolean {
		return msg != null && msg.uploadStatus != null && String(msg.uploadStatus) === 'uploading'
	}

	function isVoiceUploadFailed(msg: any): boolean {
		return msg != null
			&& msg.localFilePath != null
			&& String(msg.localFilePath) !== ''
			&& msg.uploadStatus != null
			&& String(msg.uploadStatus) === 'failed'
	}

	function isVoiceSendFailed(msg: any): boolean {
		if (isVoiceUploadFailed(msg)) {
			return false
		}
		const statusVal: any = msg != null ? (msg as any).status : null
		return statusVal === MessageStatus.FAILED || statusVal === 5 || statusVal === '5' || statusVal === 'failed'
	}

	function shouldShowVoiceUnreadDot(msg: any): boolean {
		if (msg == null || resolveMessageIsSelf((msg as any).isSelf, (msg as any).senderId)) {
			return false
		}
		return !isVoicePlayedFlag((msg as any).voicePlayed)
	}

	function resolveVoiceDurationMs(msg: any): number {
		let durationMs = msg != null && (msg as any).durationMs != null ? Number((msg as any).durationMs) : 0
		if (durationMs <= 0) {
			const durationSec = msg != null && msg.duration != null ? Number(msg.duration) : 0
			if (durationSec > 0) {
				durationMs = Math.round(durationSec * 1000)
			}
		}
		if (durationMs <= 0) {
			durationMs = 1000
		}
		return Math.max(1000, Math.round(durationMs))
	}

	function resolveVoiceDurationSeconds(msg: any): number {
		const durationMs = resolveVoiceDurationMs(msg)
		if (durationMs > 0) {
			return Math.max(1, Math.round(durationMs / 1000))
		}
		let durationSec = msg != null && msg.duration != null ? Number(msg.duration) : 0
		if (durationSec <= 0) {
			durationSec = 1
		}
		return Math.max(1, Math.round(durationSec))
	}

	function resolveVoicePlaybackProgressMs(msg: any): number {
		const messageId = resolveVoiceMessageId(msg)
		if (messageId === '') {
			return 0
		}
		if (activePlayingVoiceMessageId.value !== messageId && activePausedVoiceMessageId.value !== messageId) {
			return 0
		}
		const fallbackDuration = resolveVoiceDurationMs(msg)
		const totalDuration = activeVoicePlaybackDurationMs.value > 0 ? Number(activeVoicePlaybackDurationMs.value) : fallbackDuration
		const safeTotal = Math.max(1000, totalDuration)
		const rawProgress = Math.max(0, Math.round(Number(activeVoicePlaybackProgressMs.value || 0)))
		return Math.min(safeTotal, rawProgress)
	}

	function shouldShowVoiceProgressBar(msg: any): boolean {
		if (msg == null) {
			return false
		}
		return isVoicePlaying(msg) || isVoicePaused(msg)
	}

	function buildVoiceProgressPercentText(msg: any): string {
		const totalMs = resolveVoiceDurationMs(msg)
		if (totalMs <= 0) {
			return '0%'
		}
		const progressMs = resolveVoicePlaybackProgressMs(msg)
		if (progressMs <= 0) {
			return '0%'
		}
		let percent = Math.round((progressMs * 100) / totalMs)
		if (percent > 0 && percent < VOICE_PROGRESS_MIN_FILL_PERCENT) {
			percent = VOICE_PROGRESS_MIN_FILL_PERCENT
		}
		if (percent > 100) {
			percent = 100
		}
		return `${percent}%`
	}

	function buildVoiceDurationText(msg: any): string {
		const totalSec = resolveVoiceDurationSeconds(msg)
		if (!shouldShowVoiceProgressBar(msg)) {
			return `${totalSec}"`
		}
		const playedSec = Math.max(0, Math.min(totalSec, Math.floor(resolveVoicePlaybackProgressMs(msg) / 1000)))
		return `${playedSec}" / ${totalSec}"`
	}

	function buildVoiceStatusText(msg: any): string {
		if (isVoiceUploading(msg)) {
			const progress = msg != null && msg.uploadProgress != null ? Number(msg.uploadProgress) : 0
			return progress > 0 ? `上传中 ${progress}%` : '上传中'
		}
		if (isVoiceUploadFailed(msg)) {
			const uploadError = msg != null && msg.uploadError != null ? String(msg.uploadError) : ''
			if (uploadError !== '') {
				return uploadError
			}
			return '点击重试上传'
		}
		if (isVoiceSendFailed(msg)) {
			return '点击重发'
		}
		return ''
	}

	function createLocalVoiceDraft(localFilePath: string, durationSec: number, durationMs: number, sourceBlob: any = null, sourceFormat: string = VOICE_RECORD_FORMAT, uploadFileName: string = ''): MessageItem {
		const timestamp = Date.now()
		const mid = `voice-local-${timestamp}-${Math.floor(Math.random() * 1000)}`
		const normalizedLocalFilePath = localFilePath != null ? String(localFilePath) : ''
		const normalizedFormat = sourceFormat && sourceFormat !== '' ? sourceFormat : VOICE_RECORD_FORMAT
		const defaultExt = normalizedFormat.indexOf('wav') >= 0 ? 'wav' : VOICE_RECORD_FORMAT
		const normalizedUploadFileName = uploadFileName && uploadFileName !== '' ? uploadFileName : `voice-${timestamp}.${defaultExt}`
		return {
			id: mid,
			messageId: mid,
			chatId: chatId.value,
			groupId: chatType.value === 'group' ? targetId.value : '',
			senderId: currentUserId.value,
			receiverId: getReceiverIdForMessage(),
			type: 'voice',
			content: '',
			isSelf: true,
			time: new Date(timestamp).toLocaleString(),
			timestamp: timestamp,
			showTime: true,
			avatarText: getAvatarTextUtil('我'),
			avatarBg: getUserAvatarColor(currentUserId.value),
			senderName: '我',
			duration: durationSec,
			durationMs: durationMs,
			format: normalizedFormat,
			voiceFormat: normalizedFormat,
			voicePlayed: true,
			localFilePath: normalizedLocalFilePath,
			uploadSourceBlob: sourceBlob,
			uploadFileName: normalizedUploadFileName,
			uploadObjectUrl: normalizedLocalFilePath.startsWith('blob:') ? normalizedLocalFilePath : '',
			uploadProgress: 0,
			uploadStatus: 'uploading',
			status: 'uploading'
		} as MessageItem
	}

	async function uploadVoiceDraft(draft: MessageItem): Promise<void> {
		const localFilePath = draft.localFilePath != null ? String(draft.localFilePath) : ''
		const sourceBlob: any = (draft as any).uploadSourceBlob != null ? (draft as any).uploadSourceBlob : null
		const sourceSizeBytes = resolveVoiceSourceSizeBytes(draft, sourceBlob)
		const uploadFileName = (draft as any).uploadFileName != null ? String((draft as any).uploadFileName) : `voice-${Date.now()}.wav`
		if (localFilePath === '' && sourceBlob == null) {
			patchMessageInList(draft.messageId, {
				uploadStatus: 'failed',
				uploadError: '语音文件不存在'
			})
			return
		}
		if (sourceSizeBytes > 0 && sourceSizeBytes > MAX_VOICE_SIZE) {
			clearVoiceDraftUploadAssets(draft, sourceBlob != null)
			;(draft as any).uploadSourceBlob = null
			removeMessageFromList(draft.messageId)
			uni.showToast({ title: buildVoiceTooLargeHint(sourceSizeBytes), icon: 'none' })
			return
		}
		const scopeReady = await ensureVoiceUploadScopeReady(false)
		if (!scopeReady) {
			patchMessageInList(draft.messageId, {
				uploadStatus: 'failed',
				uploadError: '会话初始化失败'
			})
			uni.showToast({ title: '会话初始化失败，请重试', icon: 'none' })
			return
		}
		patchMessageInList(draft.messageId, {
			uploadStatus: 'uploading',
			uploadError: '',
			uploadProgress: 0
		})
		try {
			const result: any = sourceBlob != null ? await uploadBlobAndReturnId(sourceBlob, uploadFileName, {
				directory: buildVoiceUploadDirectory(),
				maxSize: MAX_VOICE_SIZE,
				onProgress: (progress) => {
					patchMessageInList(draft.messageId, { uploadProgress: progress })
				}
			}) : await uploadFileAndReturnId(localFilePath, {
				directory: buildVoiceUploadDirectory(),
				maxSize: MAX_VOICE_SIZE,
				onProgress: (progress) => {
					patchMessageInList(draft.messageId, { uploadProgress: progress })
				}
			})
			const data: any = result != null ? result.data : null
			const fileId = data != null && data.fileId != null ? String(data.fileId) : ''
			if (fileId === '' || fileId === '0') {
				throw new Error('fileId 为空')
			}
			const voiceUrl = data != null && data.url != null ? String(data.url) : ''
			const normalizedUrl = voiceUrl.startsWith('/') ? CONFIG_BASE_URL + voiceUrl : voiceUrl
			const voiceSize = data != null && data.size != null ? Number(data.size) : 0
			const fallbackFormat = draft.format != null && String(draft.format) !== '' ? String(draft.format) : VOICE_RECORD_FORMAT
			const voiceFormat = data != null && data.mimeType != null && String(data.mimeType) !== '' ? String(data.mimeType) : fallbackFormat
			const voiceMd5 = data != null && data.md5 != null ? String(data.md5) : ''
			clearVoiceDraftUploadAssets(draft, sourceBlob != null)
			;(draft as any).uploadSourceBlob = null
			removeMessageFromList(draft.messageId)
			const sent = messageService.sendVoiceMessageV2(
				getReceiverIdForMessage(),
				getGroupIdForMessage(),
				fileId,
				normalizedUrl,
				draft.duration != null ? Number(draft.duration) : 1,
				voiceSize,
				draft.durationMs != null ? Number(draft.durationMs) : ((draft.duration != null ? Number(draft.duration) : 1) * 1000),
				voiceFormat,
				voiceMd5
			)
			;(sent as any).fileId = fileId
			;(sent as any).duration = draft.duration
			;(sent as any).durationMs = draft.durationMs
			;(sent as any).size = voiceSize
			;(sent as any).format = voiceFormat
			;(sent as any).voiceSize = voiceSize
			;(sent as any).voiceFormat = voiceFormat
			;(sent as any).voicePlayed = true
			;(sent as any).localFilePath = sourceBlob == null ? localFilePath : ''
			;(sent as any).md5 = voiceMd5
			scrollToBottom()
		} catch (e) {
			console.error('[Chat] 上传语音失败:', e)
			clearVoiceDraftUploadAssets(draft, sourceBlob != null)
			if (isVoiceTooLargeError(e)) {
				;(draft as any).uploadSourceBlob = null
				removeMessageFromList(draft.messageId)
				uni.showToast({ title: buildVoiceTooLargeHint(), icon: 'none' })
				return
			}
			patchMessageInList(draft.messageId, {
				uploadStatus: 'failed',
				uploadError: '语音上传失败'
			})
			uni.showToast({ title: '语音上传失败，点击重试', icon: 'none' })
		}
	}

	function retryVoiceUpload(msg: any): void {
		if (msg == null) {
			return
		}
		void uploadVoiceDraft(msg as MessageItem)
	}

	function retryVoiceSend(msg: any): void {
		if (msg == null || msg.messageId == null) {
			return
		}
		const ok = messageService.retryMessage(String(msg.messageId))
		if (!ok) {
			uni.showToast({ title: '语音发送失败，无法重发', icon: 'none' })
			return
		}
	}

	function handleVoiceBubbleClick(msg: any): void {
		if (multiSelectMode.value) {
			handleBubbleClick(msg as MessageItem)
			return
		}
		if (isVoiceUploading(msg)) {
			return
		}
		if (isVoiceUploadFailed(msg)) {
			retryVoiceUpload(msg)
			return
		}
		if (isVoiceSendFailed(msg)) {
			retryVoiceSend(msg)
			return
		}
		const statusVal: any = msg != null ? (msg as any).status : null
		if (statusVal === MessageStatus.SENDING || statusVal === 0 || statusVal === '0' || statusVal === 'sending') {
			return
		}
		markVoicePlayedOnClick(msg)
		handleVoicePlay(msg)
	}

	function handleVoicePauseClick(msg: any): void {
		const messageId = resolveVoiceMessageId(msg)
		if (messageId === '' || !isVoicePlaying(msg)) {
			return
		}
		pauseCurrentVoicePlayback(messageId)
	}

	function handleVoiceResumeClick(msg: any): void {
		const messageId = resolveVoiceMessageId(msg)
		if (messageId === '') {
			return
		}
		if (activePausedVoiceMessageId.value !== messageId || voiceAudioContext == null || activeVoiceContextMessageId !== messageId) {
			handleVoicePlay(msg)
			return
		}
		try {
			refreshVoicePlaybackProgressFromContext(messageId)
			activePlayingVoiceMessageId.value = messageId
			activePausedVoiceMessageId.value = ''
			startPlaybackWaveAnimation()
			voiceAudioContext.play()
		} catch (e) {
			console.error('[Chat] 恢复语音播放失败:', e)
			handleVoicePlay(msg)
		}
	}

	function handleVoicePlay(msg : any) {
		Promise.resolve().then(async () => {
			const fileId = msg && msg.fileId ? String(msg.fileId) : ''
			if (fileId === '' || fileId === '0') {
				uni.showToast({ title: '语音文件不可用', icon: 'none' })
				return
			}
			const url = await resolvePresignedUrl(fileId)
			if (!url) {
				uni.showToast({ title: '语音播放地址获取失败', icon: 'none' })
				return
			}
			try {
				const messageId = resolveVoiceMessageId(msg)
				if (messageId === '') {
					uni.showToast({ title: '语音消息标识异常', icon: 'none' })
					return
				}
				stopCurrentVoicePlayback()
				const audioContext = uni.createInnerAudioContext()
				voiceAudioContext = audioContext
				activeVoiceContextMessageId = messageId
				activeVoicePlaybackProgressMs.value = 0
				activeVoicePlaybackDurationMs.value = resolveVoiceDurationMs(msg)
				activePausedVoiceMessageId.value = ''
				audioContext.autoplay = false
				audioContext.src = url
				audioContext.onCanplay(() => {
					if (voiceAudioContext !== audioContext) {
						return
					}
					try {
						setTimeout(() => {
							try {
								if (voiceAudioContext !== audioContext) {
									return
								}
								const rawDurationSec = Number((audioContext as any).duration || 0)
								if (rawDurationSec > 0) {
									syncVoiceDurationFromPlayback(msg, rawDurationSec)
									activeVoicePlaybackDurationMs.value = Math.max(1000, Math.round(rawDurationSec * 1000))
								}
							} catch (e) {
								// ignore
							}
						}, 80)
					} catch (e) {
						// ignore
					}
				})
				audioContext.onTimeUpdate(() => {
					if (voiceAudioContext !== audioContext) {
						return
					}
					refreshVoicePlaybackProgressFromContext(messageId)
				})
				audioContext.onPlay(() => {
					if (voiceAudioContext !== audioContext) {
						return
					}
					if (messageId !== '') {
						activePlayingVoiceMessageId.value = messageId
						activePausedVoiceMessageId.value = ''
						refreshVoicePlaybackProgressFromContext(messageId)
						startPlaybackWaveAnimation()
					}
					if (msg != null && !resolveMessageIsSelf((msg as any).isSelf, (msg as any).senderId) && messageId !== '' && !hasVoiceBeenPlayed(messageId)) {
						markVoicePlayed(messageId)
						patchMessageInList(messageId, { voicePlayed: true })
						syncVoicePlayedToServer(messageId)
					}
				})
				audioContext.onPause(() => {
					if (voiceAudioContext !== audioContext) {
						return
					}
					refreshVoicePlaybackProgressFromContext(messageId)
					activePlayingVoiceMessageId.value = ''
					activePausedVoiceMessageId.value = messageId
					stopPlaybackWaveAnimation()
				})
				audioContext.onEnded(() => {
					if (voiceAudioContext !== audioContext) {
						return
					}
					releaseVoicePlaybackContext()
				})
				audioContext.onStop(() => {
					if (voiceAudioContext !== audioContext) {
						return
					}
					releaseVoicePlaybackContext()
				})
				audioContext.onError((err: any) => {
					if (voiceAudioContext !== audioContext) {
						return
					}
					console.error('[Chat] 语音播放失败:', err)
					releaseVoicePlaybackContext()
					uni.showToast({ title: '播放失败', icon: 'none' })
				})
				audioContext.play()
			} catch (e) {
				console.error('[Chat] 语音播放异常:', e)
				stopCurrentVoicePlayback()
				uni.showToast({ title: '播放失败', icon: 'none' })
			}
		})
	}

	function scrollToBottom() {
		setTimeout(() => {
			lastMessageId.value = 'msg-' + (messages.value.length - 1)
		}, 100)
	}

	function registerH5VisibilityChangeListener(): void {
		// #ifdef H5
		try {
			if (h5VisibilityChangeHandler != null) {
				return
			}
			if (typeof document === 'undefined') {
				return
			}
			h5VisibilityChangeHandler = () => {
				try {
					if (document.visibilityState === 'hidden') {
						persistViewportState()
						cancelActiveVoiceRecording()
						stopCurrentVoicePlayback()
					}
				} catch (e) {
					// ignore
				}
			}
			document.addEventListener('visibilitychange', h5VisibilityChangeHandler)
		} catch (e) {
			h5VisibilityChangeHandler = null
		}
		// #endif
	}

	function unregisterH5VisibilityChangeListener(): void {
		// #ifdef H5
		try {
			if (h5VisibilityChangeHandler == null) {
				return
			}
			if (typeof document !== 'undefined') {
				document.removeEventListener('visibilitychange', h5VisibilityChangeHandler)
			}
		} catch (e) {
			// ignore
		}
		h5VisibilityChangeHandler = null
		// #endif
	}

	function readViewportState(): ChatViewportState | null {
		try {
			return messageService.readChatViewportState(chatId.value, CHAT_VIEWPORT_TTL_MS) as ChatViewportState | null
		} catch (e) {
			return null
		}
	}

	function applyRestoreEntryIfAvailable(): void {
		if (targetAnchorSequence.value !== '' || targetMessageId.value !== '') {
			return
		}
		const state = readViewportState()
		if (state == null) {
			return
		}
		if (state.atBottom === true) {
			entryMode.value = 'latest'
			return
		}
		const anchor = state.viewportAnchorSequence != null ? String(state.viewportAnchorSequence) : ''
		if (anchor !== '' && anchor !== '0') {
			entryMode.value = 'restore'
			targetAnchorSequence.value = anchor
		}
	}

	function captureViewportStateAsync(callback: (state: ChatViewportState) => void): void {
		try {
			const fallbackTop = messages.value.length > 0 && messages.value[0] && (messages.value[0] as any).sequence != null
				? String((messages.value[0] as any).sequence)
				: ''
			const fallbackBottom = messages.value.length > 0 && messages.value[messages.value.length - 1] && (messages.value[messages.value.length - 1] as any).sequence != null
				? String((messages.value[messages.value.length - 1] as any).sequence)
				: ''
			const fallbackAnchor = isAtBottom.value ? fallbackBottom : fallbackTop
			const fallbackState: ChatViewportState = {
				entryMode: entryMode.value,
				atBottom: isAtBottom.value,
				viewportAnchorSequence: fallbackAnchor,
				topVisibleSequence: fallbackTop,
				bottomVisibleSequence: fallbackBottom,
				savedAt: Date.now()
			}
			const inst = getCurrentInstance()
			const ctx = inst != null ? (inst as any).proxy : null
			if (ctx == null || messages.value.length === 0) {
				callback(fallbackState)
				return
			}
			uni.nextTick(() => {
				try {
					const q = uni.createSelectorQuery().in(ctx)
					q.selectAll('.read-observe-item').boundingClientRect((rects: any) => {
						try {
							const arr = rects as any[]
							if (arr == null || arr.length === 0) {
								callback(fallbackState)
								return
							}
							const sys = uni.getSystemInfoSync()
							const viewportBottom = sys != null && (sys as any).windowHeight != null ? Number((sys as any).windowHeight) : 812
							let topSeq = ''
							let bottomSeq = ''
							for (let i = 0; i < arr.length && i < messages.value.length; i++) {
								const rect = arr[i]
								if (rect == null) {
									continue
								}
								const top = rect.top != null ? Number(rect.top) : 0
								const bottom = rect.bottom != null ? Number(rect.bottom) : 0
								const seq = messages.value[i] && (messages.value[i] as any).sequence != null ? String((messages.value[i] as any).sequence) : ''
								if (seq === '' || seq === '0') {
									continue
								}
								if (topSeq === '' && bottom > 88) {
									topSeq = seq
								}
								if (top < viewportBottom && bottom > 88) {
									bottomSeq = seq
								}
							}
							const anchor = isAtBottom.value
								? (bottomSeq !== '' ? bottomSeq : fallbackBottom)
								: (topSeq !== '' ? topSeq : fallbackAnchor)
							callback({
								entryMode: entryMode.value,
								atBottom: isAtBottom.value,
								viewportAnchorSequence: anchor,
								topVisibleSequence: topSeq !== '' ? topSeq : fallbackTop,
								bottomVisibleSequence: bottomSeq !== '' ? bottomSeq : fallbackBottom,
								savedAt: Date.now()
							})
						} catch (e) {
							callback(fallbackState)
						}
					}).exec()
				} catch (e) {
					callback(fallbackState)
				}
			})
		} catch (e) {
			// ignore
		}
	}

	function persistViewportState(): void {
		if (!chatId.value || chatId.value === '' || chatId.value === '0') {
			return
		}
		captureViewportStateAsync((state: ChatViewportState) => {
			try {
				messageService.saveChatViewportState(chatId.value, state as any)
			} catch (e) {
				// ignore
			}
		})
	}
	
	/**
	 * 滚动到目标消息并高亮显示
	 */
	function findMessageIndexForTargetId(messageId: string): number {
		return messages.value.findIndex(msg => {
			const mid = msg && (msg as any).messageId != null ? String((msg as any).messageId) : ''
			const id = msg && (msg as any).id != null ? String((msg as any).id) : ''
			return mid === messageId || id === messageId
		})
	}

	async function scrollToTargetMessage(messageId: string) {
		console.log('[Chat] 开始定位消息', messageId)
		
		let messageIndex = findMessageIndexForTargetId(messageId)
		if (messageIndex === -1) {
			const foundAfterLoad = await loadAnchorWindow(targetAnchorSequence.value !== '' ? targetAnchorSequence.value : null, messageId)
			if (!foundAfterLoad) {
				return
			}
			messageIndex = findMessageIndexForTargetId(messageId)
		}
		
		if (messageIndex === -1) {
			console.warn('[Chat] 未找到目标消息', messageId)
			uni.showToast({
				title: '消息不在当前页面',
				icon: 'none'
			})
			return
		}
		
		console.log('[Chat] 找到消息，索引', messageIndex)
		
		// 滚动到目标消息
		lastMessageId.value = 'msg-' + messageIndex
		
		// 如果需要高亮显示
		if (shouldHighlight.value) {
			const targetMsg = messages.value[messageIndex]
			const highlightId = getSelectMessageId(targetMsg)
			highlightedMessageId.value = highlightId
			console.log('[Chat] 高亮显示消息:', highlightId)
			
			// 3秒后取消高亮
			setTimeout(() => {
				highlightedMessageId.value = ''
				console.log('[Chat] 取消高亮显示')
			}, 3000)
		}
		
		// 清空目标消息ID，避免重复定位
		targetMessageId.value = ''
	}
	
	/**
	 * 页面加载时获取参数
	 */
	onLoad(async (options : any) => {
		await loadRecallConfig()
		currentUserId.value = getUserIdStr()
		currentTenantId.value = getTenantId() || '0'
		messageService.setCurrentUser(currentUserId.value, currentTenantId.value)
		let hasExplicitEntryIntent = false
		let routeOptions: any = options
		try {
			const sid = options != null ? (options['stateId'] as any) : null
			if (sid != null && sid !== '') {
				const stateObj = consumeNavState(String(sid))
				if (stateObj != null && typeof stateObj === 'object') {
					routeOptions = {} as any
					if (options != null && typeof options === 'object') {
						for (const k in options) {
							;(routeOptions as any)[k] = (options as any)[k]
						}
					}
					for (const k in stateObj as any) {
						;(routeOptions as any)[k] = (stateObj as any)[k]
					}
				}
			}
		} catch (e) {
			routeOptions = options
		}
		// 获取 ChatID（字符串，避免精度丢失）
		if (routeOptions['chatId']) {
			chatId.value = decodeIdParam(routeOptions['chatId'])
		}
		
		// 获取目标 ID（字符串，避免精度丢失）
		if (routeOptions['targetId']) {
			targetId.value = decodeIdParam(routeOptions['targetId'])
		}
		
		// 获取聊天类型
		let hasExplicitChatType = false
		if (routeOptions['type']) {
			chatType.value = routeOptions['type']
			hasExplicitChatType = true
		}

		// 兼容：部分入口使用 targetType 标识会话类型（2=群聊，1=单聊）
		// 若未显式传 type，则按 targetType 推断 chatType，避免群聊被误判为单聊导致 @ 功能无法触发
		try {
			const tt = routeOptions['targetType']
			if (!hasExplicitChatType && tt != null && tt !== '') {
				const ttStr = tt.toString()
				if (ttStr === '2') {
					chatType.value = 'group'
				}
				if (ttStr === '1') {
					chatType.value = 'single'
				}
			}
		} catch (e) {
			// ignore
		}
		
		// 获取群聊 ID（字符串，避免精度丢失）
		if (routeOptions['groupId']) {
			groupId.value = decodeIdParam(routeOptions['groupId'])
			targetId.value = groupId.value  // 群聊时 targetId 就是 groupId
			if (!hasExplicitChatType) {
				chatType.value = 'group'
			}
		}

		// 兼容：仅传 targetId + targetType=2 的群聊跳转场景
		if ((groupId.value == null || groupId.value === '' || groupId.value === '0')
			&& (chatType.value === 'group')
			&& targetId.value && targetId.value !== '' && targetId.value !== '0') {
			groupId.value = targetId.value
		}
		
		// 获取名称
		if (routeOptions['name']) {
			name.value = decodeURIComponent(routeOptions['name'])
		}
		
		// 获取成员数量
		if (routeOptions['memberCount']) {
			memberCount.value = parseInt(routeOptions['memberCount'])
		}

		if (routeOptions['entryMode']) {
			const modeStr = String(routeOptions['entryMode'])
			if (modeStr === 'anchor' || modeStr === 'restore' || modeStr === 'latest') {
				entryMode.value = modeStr
				hasExplicitEntryIntent = true
			}
		}

		if (routeOptions['conversationBizType']) {
			conversationBizType.value = String(routeOptions['conversationBizType'])
		}

		if (routeOptions['bizSessionId']) {
			bizSessionId.value = String(routeOptions['bizSessionId'])
		}

		if (routeOptions['serviceState']) {
			serviceState.value = String(routeOptions['serviceState'])
		}

		if (routeOptions['readOnly'] != null && routeOptions['readOnly'] !== '') {
			const readOnlyRaw = String(routeOptions['readOnly'])
			conversationReadOnly.value = readOnlyRaw === 'true' || readOnlyRaw === '1'
		}

		if (routeOptions['anchorSequence']) {
			targetAnchorSequence.value = routeOptions['anchorSequence'] as string
			entryMode.value = 'anchor'
			hasExplicitEntryIntent = true
		}
		
		// 获取要定位的消息ID（从搜索页面跳转过来）
		if (routeOptions['messageId']) {
			targetMessageId.value = routeOptions['messageId'] as string
			entryMode.value = 'anchor'
			hasExplicitEntryIntent = true
			console.log('[Chat] 需要定位到消息:', targetMessageId.value)
		} else if (routeOptions['anchorMessageId']) {
			targetMessageId.value = routeOptions['anchorMessageId'] as string
			entryMode.value = 'anchor'
			hasExplicitEntryIntent = true
		}
		
		// 获取是否需要高亮显示
		if (routeOptions['highlight']) {
			shouldHighlight.value = routeOptions['highlight'] === 'true'
			console.log('[Chat] 需要高亮显示消息')
		}
		try {
			const from = routeOptions['fromMergeDetail']
			fromMergeDetail.value = from != null && String(from) === '1'
		} catch (e) {
			fromMergeDetail.value = false
		}
		try {
			const d = routeOptions['mergeBackDelta']
			const n = d != null && d !== '' ? Number(d) : 1
			mergeBackDelta.value = !isNaN(n) && n > 0 ? n : 1
		} catch (e) {
			mergeBackDelta.value = 1
		}
		
		console.log('[Chat] 页面参数:', {
			chatId: chatId.value,
			targetId: targetId.value,
			chatType: chatType.value,
			name: name.value,
			conversationBizType: conversationBizType.value,
			bizSessionId: bizSessionId.value,
			serviceState: serviceState.value,
			readOnly: conversationReadOnly.value,
			messageId: targetMessageId.value,
			highlight: shouldHighlight.value
		})

		// H5 刷新时 onMounted 可能早于参数可用，确保路由参数就绪后一定触发一次会话初始化与消息加载
		await ensureChatIdByTargetIfNeeded(false)
		if (!hasExplicitEntryIntent) {
			applyRestoreEntryIfAvailable()
		}
		await hydrateConversationMetaByChatId()
		if (chatType.value === 'group') {
			void ensureMentionMembersLoaded()
		}
		try {
			if (chatId.value && chatId.value !== '' && chatId.value !== '0') {
				messageService.setActiveChatId(chatId.value)
			}
		} catch (e) {
			// ignore
		}
		await ensureInitialMessagesLoaded()
	})

	async function loadRecallConfig() {
		try {
			const config = await getRecallConfig()
			const seconds = config != null && config.windowSeconds != null ? Number(config.windowSeconds) : 120
			if (seconds > 0) {
				recallWindowMs.value = seconds * 1000
			}
		} catch (e) {
			recallWindowMs.value = 2 * 60 * 1000
		}
	}

	onShow(() => {
		wsManager.setRealtimeBizActive(true)
		initVisibleReadObserver()
		startReeditTicker()
		startVoicePlayedCompensation()
		refreshCustomStickers().then(list => {
			stickerList.value = list
		}).catch(() => {
		})
		try {
			if (chatId.value && chatId.value !== '' && chatId.value !== '0') {
				messageService.setActiveChatId(chatId.value)
				messageService.setActiveChatAutoReadEnabled(isAtBottom.value)
			}
		} catch (e) {
			// ignore
		}
	})

	onHide(() => {
		wsManager.setRealtimeBizActive(false)
		closeMentionSelector()
		persistViewportState()
		void flushReadOnLeave()
		void flushVoicePlayedSyncQueue(true)
		destroyVisibleReadObserver()
		stopReeditTicker()
		stopVoicePlayedCompensation()
		cancelActiveVoiceRecording()
		stopCurrentVoicePlayback()
		try {
			messageService.setActiveChatAutoReadEnabled(false)
			messageService.setActiveChatId(null)
		} catch (e) {
			// ignore
		}
	})

	onUnload(() => {
		unregisterH5VisibilityChangeListener()
		wsManager.setRealtimeBizActive(false)
		closeMentionSelector()
		persistViewportState()
		void flushReadOnLeave()
		void flushVoicePlayedSyncQueue(true)
		destroyVisibleReadObserver()
		stopReeditTicker()
		stopVoicePlayedCompensation()
		cancelActiveVoiceRecording()
		stopCurrentVoicePlayback()
		cleanupContactCardSelectListener()
		cleanupH5VoiceRecorderRuntime()
		messageService.removeMessageListener(handleNewMessage)
		messageService.removeMessageStatusListener(handleMessageStatusChange)
		messageService.removeVoicePlayedListener(handleVoicePlayedSync)
		try {
			messageService.setActiveChatAutoReadEnabled(false)
			messageService.setActiveChatId(null)
		} catch (e) {
			// ignore
		}
	})
</script>

